          "quote": "Therefore, it can be concluded that pre-deformation induced hysteresis expansion is closely associated with solution of Nb in the matrix. It is reasonable to consid er that the solution of Nb in the NiTi matrix can change the kinetics of mart-ensitic or reverse martensitic transformation.",
